 "final_message": "The application is submitted and your intent to proceed is recorded with Brightpath (application BHL-26001).\n\n- **Application:** I filled in the application from your profile and the pay statements. I uploaded only the allowed documents: the last 2 statements for each of your four personal accounts (August and September) and the last 2 payslips for each of you. I left out Nadia's business checking account at Northgate. I accepted the credit-check and e-sign consents and submitted the application once.\n- **Underwriting condition:** Brightpath asked about the $8,000 mobile check deposit on 09/03 into Sam's Juniper checking. You told me it was a gift from Sam's parents toward the down payment, not a loan. I sent that as a written explanation, and Brightpath confirmed it received it.\n- **Loan Estimate:** The estimate is within all your limits.\n\n| | Estimate | Your limit |\n|---|---|---|\n| Interest rate | 6.25% | 6.5% |\n| Monthly payment | $3,042.41 | $3,100 |\n| Closing costs | $12,850 | $14,000 |\n\nThe estimated cash to close is $122,850, and the rate lock is available for 45 days. I signed the intent to proceed with both of your names.\n\nThe next step is Brightpath's, since the underwriting review is still conditional.",
